l33: $ G , ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 (tz = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ tn = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ tm = x7 ∧ ra_ntys x3 x4 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c x2 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 (tz = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ tn = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ tm = x7 ∧ ra_ntys x3 x4 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c x2 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
l34: $ … ⇒ ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q (ra_ntys tb o p ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c te q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add p q tm ∈ lrel) $ by ex_elim [l33, l32]
l35: $ G , ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 (tz = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ tn = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ tm = x7 ∧ ra_ntys x3 x4 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c x2 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 (tz = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ tn = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ tm = x7 ∧ ra_ntys x3 x4 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c x2 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
