l37: $ G , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 (tz = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ tn = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ tm = x7 ∧ ra_ntys x3 x4 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c x2 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 (tz = ⟨ kc_tcons , scons x1 (scons x2 (scons x3 ∅)) ⟩ ∧ tn = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ tm = x7 ∧ ra_ntys x3 x4 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_clen_c x2 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x5 x6 x7 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
