l2: $ G , r ⊆ ifold u E D w p mv , r ⊆ {y | y ∊ imrel D cv} , z ∊ ifold0 u E D w p mv r , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o w (scat p (ixs D w (ifam u E D w))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D w , h ∊ ihv D o r g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g w ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o w (scat p (ixs D w (ifam u E D w))) $ by ax
l3: $ G , r ⊆ ifold u E D w p mv , r ⊆ {y | y ∊ imrel D cv} , z ∊ ifold0 u E D w p mv r , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o w (scat p (ixs D w (ifam u E D w))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D w , h ∊ ihv D o r g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g w ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D w $ by ax
l4: $ G , r ⊆ ifold u E D w p mv , r ⊆ {y | y ∊ imrel D cv} , z ∊ ifold0 u E D w p mv r , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o w (scat p (ixs D w (ifam u E D w))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D w , h ∊ ihv D o r g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g w ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ h ∊ ihv D o r g t (cdm f) $ by ax
l5: $ G , r ⊆ ifold u E D w p mv , r ⊆ {y | y ∊ imrel D cv} , z ∊ ifold0 u E D w p mv r , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o w (scat p (ixs D w (ifam u E D w))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D w , h ∊ ihv D o r g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g w ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ iminx D j c k $ by ax
l6: $ G , r ⊆ ifold u E D w p mv , r ⊆ {y | y ∊ imrel D cv} , z ∊ ifold0 u E D w p mv r , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o w (scat p (ixs D w (ifam u E D w))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D w , h ∊ ihv D o r g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g w ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u $ by ax
l7: $ G , r ⊆ ifold u E D w p mv , r ⊆ {y | y ∊ imrel D cv} , z ∊ ifold0 u E D w p mv r , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o w (scat p (ixs D w (ifam u E D w))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D w , h ∊ ihv D o r g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g w ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g w ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ $ by ax
l8: $ G , r ⊆ ifold u E D w p mv , r ⊆ {y | y ∊ imrel D cv} , z ∊ ifold0 u E D w p mv r , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o w (scat p (ixs D w (ifam u E D w))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D w , h ∊ ihv D o r g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g w ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ , x ∊ r ⇒ r ⊆ {y | y ∊ imrel D cv} $ by ax
l9: $ G , r ⊆ ifold u E D w p mv , r ⊆ {y | y ∊ imrel D cv} , z ∊ ifold0 u E D w p mv r , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o w (scat p (ixs D w (ifam u E D w))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D w , h ∊ ihv D o r g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g w ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ , x ∊ r ⇒ x ∊ r $ by ax
l10: $ … ⇒ x ∊ imrel D cv $ by cab_elim [subset_elim [l8, l9]]
l11: $ G , r ⊆ ifold u E D w p mv , r ⊆ {y | y ∊ imrel D cv} , z ∊ ifold0 u E D w p mv r , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o w (scat p (ixs D w (ifam u E D w))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D w , h ∊ ihv D o r g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g w ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ r ⊆ imrel D cv $ by subset_intro [l10]
l12: $ … ⇒ o ∈ trees ω $ by ictk_tree [l1]
l13: $ G , r ⊆ ifold u E D w p mv , r ⊆ {y | y ∊ imrel D cv} , z ∊ ifold0 u E D w p mv r , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o w (scat p (ixs D w (ifam u E D w))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D w , h ∊ ihv D o r g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g w ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ p ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#3]
l14: $ G , r ⊆ ifold u E D w p mv , r ⊆ {y | y ∊ imrel D cv} , z ∊ ifold0 u E D w p mv r , ictk D j c o , ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E o w (scat p (ixs D w (ifam u E D w))) , ⟨ j , ⟨ a , scons c g ⟩ ⟩ ∈ ifam u E D w , h ∊ ihv D o r g t (cdm f) , iminx D j c k , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ∈ u , z = ⟨ ⟨ j , ⟨ a , itup D j c g w ⟩ ⟩ , apn (vat mv (inmin D) k) (scat h f) ⟩ ⇒ ixs D w (ifam u E D w) ∈ fseq u $ by weaken [#4]
